ADR refs    : ADR-002, ADR-004, ADR-005, ADR-006, ADR-011, ADR-013, ADR-014, ADR-015
Runner      : .NET 10.0.300 SDK present (dotnet --version 10.0.300) — NOT blocked. WindowsAppSDK builds the full
