             "translation.orders.title", "Active Orders"); bound to the PageContainer header via
             TeslaOrdersPageViewModel.Title (TeslaOrdersPage.ViewModel.cs) → TeslaOrdersPage.cs `new PageContainer(
             localizer, _viewModel.Title)`. resw entry name="translation.orders.title" present in en/he/ar. Tests
             Registration_resolves_the_two_parity_strings + Registration_routes_every_string_through_the_localizer
             + ViewModel_exposes_the_resolved_title_and_subtitle (TeslaOrdersPageTests.cs).
[x] string - orders.subtitle -> TeslaOrdersRegistration.Subtitle (TeslaOrdersPage.Model.cs) localizer.GetString(
             "translation.orders.subtitle", "Vehicle orders and delivery tracking from Tesla"); bound via
             TeslaOrdersPageViewModel.Subtitle → TeslaOrdersPage.cs `PageContainer { Subtitle = _viewModel.Subtitle }`.
             resw entry name="translation.orders.subtitle" present in en/he/ar. Same tests as above assert the value,
             the localizer key and the VM projection.

